e to federal assault-style gun ban","summary":"The 2020 ban covered 1,500 models including the AR-15 and has grown to more than 2,500; the owners' amnesty now runs until 90 days after the ruling.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12143378/federal-firearms-ban-supreme-court-arguments/","id":"n9","published":"2026-11-09"},{"cat":"AI","title":"Anthropic releases Mythos 5.2 and Fable 5.2 models","summary":"Anthropic cites gains in coding, reasoning and vision, cut Fable's input price from $10 to $8 per million tokens and says responses are 30% faster.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/09/anthropic-releases-new-mythos-and-fable-models-amid-rsi-concerns/","id":"n10","published":"2026-11-09"},{"cat":"World","title":"Israel's president taps Gadi Eisenkot to try to form a government","summary":"No bloc reached the 61 of 120 Knesset seats needed after the Oct. 27 election; Netanyahu's coalition fell to 53 seats and Eisenkot's bloc won 48.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12141815/israel-government-whats-next-eisenkot-to-lead/","id":"n11","published":"2026-11-08"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Carney names Bridgewater's Karen Karniol-Tambour to lead Canada Strong Fund","summary":"She becomes first CEO of Canada's new sovereign wealth fund, which starts with a $25-billion commitment and a retail option for individual Canadians.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12142782/carney-canada-strong-fund-ceo/","id":"n12","published":"2026-11-09"},{"cat":"Major","title":"COP31 climate talks open in Antalya, Turkey","summary":"The UN summit runs Nov. 9-20, with debates over Turkey's '35-by-35' electrification goal and adaptation finance; the U.S. is not taking part.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/09/we-will-not-lower-our-ambition-everything-you-need-to-know-on-day-one-of-the-cop31-climate","id":"n13","published":"2026-11-09"},{"cat":"Business","title":"Stellantis to